          "caption": "Bolton Steam Museum - erectors at work This is the unique vertical cross compound engine from Dearneside mills, Denby Dale. It had spent 30 years in a dismantled state and is now being lovingly re-erected by the small band of dedicated enthusiasts of the Northern Mill Engine Society. I will post a picture when it is finished.",
